    "Result": "The story of nien nien is a monster. He lives in the hills. At the end of every year, he goes into the village and eats people. One day an old man comes to the village. Nian is afraid of the color red. Soon it is the last day of the year. Nen comes down from the hills. He sees red paper on the doors and Windows. He also sees red firecrackers. He feels afraid and runs back into the hills. The people in the village never see nen again. They use red things and like that.Crackers at the spring festival every year.",
